      <h1>Competency Development for <em>AI Doctoral Students</em><br>Through Experiential Learning</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        I'm Zhu Jun — 9 years of project management experience (research PM from 2021 Shanghai Hollywave, AI projects from 2023 Sixents/NavInfo), Research Project Manager at Beijing Zhongguancun Academy & AI Research Institute, studying competency development for AI doctoral students.
