          <p>AI evolves monthly, doctoral training spans years. Students master model accuracy but lack project delivery, team collaboration, and cross-domain transfer competencies demanded by industry.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Dual pressure: academic output vs. industry readiness</li>
            <li>Research projects lack intentional competency design</li>
            <li>Structural mismatch between employability and career development</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
